# Example configuration for the AI Interview Coach backend.
#
# Milestone 1 does not read any environment variables yet, so nothing here is
# required to run the server or the tests.
#
# How to use this file later:
#   1. Copy it:  cp .env.example .env
#   2. Fill in real values in .env only. .env is git-ignored; this file is not.
#   3. Never put real secrets, passwords or API keys in .env.example.
#
# Variables will be added here as later milestones need them
# (for example a database URL or the allowed frontend origin).
